OL,3,GNEWSAMan with spinal injury completes
OL,4,AChannel challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man living with a spinal injury has
OL,7,Fcompleted the challenge of travelling
OL,8,Ffrom Marble Arch in London to the Arc
OL,9,Fde Triomphe in Paris to raise money for
OL,10,Fthe charities which helped him.
OL,12,FJon Cooke, who lives near Canterbury,
OL,13,FKent, started the 290-mile (466km) Para
OL,14,FArch to Arc Challenge on Friday and
OL,15,Ftold the BBC he was "so relieved" to
OL,16,Fhave completed it on Tuesday - despite
OL,17,Fdelays caused by the soaring
OL,18,Ftemperatures.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
