OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAMan with spinal injury completes
OL,4,AChannel challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is believed Cooke is the first
OL,7,Fperson with a spinal cord injury to
OL,8,Fhave accomplished the challenge,
OL,9,Faccording to the Spinal Injuries
OL,10,FAssociation.
OL,12,FThe 46-year-old said his
OL,13,Faccomplishment, which included an
OL,14,F87-mile (140km) handbike ride from
OL,15,FLondon to Dover, a 21-mile (33km) row
OL,16,Fin the Channel, and a 182-mile (292km)
OL,17,Fhandbike ride, had "not sunk in yet".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
